      "paragraph_id": "P001",
      "anchor": "By 1993, Gucci had achieved something almost impossible. Its name",
      "pace": "slower",
      "intent": "curious",
      "emphasis": [
        "owned none of the company"
      ],
      "pause_after_seconds": 1,
      "pronunciation_notes": [],
      "inflection": "settled"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "P003",
      "anchor": "That sounds like the ending. It is actually the puzzle. How does ",
      "pace": "natural",
