      ],
      "pause_after_seconds": 1,
      "pronunciation_notes": [],
      "inflection": "settled"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "P009",
      "anchor": "A federal judge in 1988 recognized Paolo's work as a designer. Bu",
