      ],
      "pause_after_seconds": 1,
      "pronunciation_notes": [],
      "inflection": "settled"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "P011",
      "anchor": "Then came the first sale. During the late 1980s, members of Aldo'",
      "pace": "natural",
      "intent": "curious",
      "emphasis": [
        "fifty percent"
      ],
      "pause_after_seconds": 0,
      "pronunciation_notes": [],
      "inflection": "settled"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "P015",
      "anchor": "The partners disagreed over how things were going. Contemporary r",
      "pace": "natural",
      "intent": "skeptical",
      "emphasis": [
        "competing claims"
      ],
      "pause_after_seconds": 1,
      "pronunciation_notes": [],
      "inflection": "settled"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "P017",
      "anchor": "In September, the stalemate ended. Investcorp bought Maurizio's r",
      "pace": "slower",
      "intent": "matter_of_fact",
      "emphasis": [
        "reported transaction estimate"
      ],
      "pause_after_seconds": 1,
      "pronunciation_notes": [],
      "inflection": "settled"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "P020",
      "anchor": "There is another important timing detail. Maurizio Gucci was kill",
      "pace": "slower",
      "intent": "matter_of_fact",
      "emphasis": [
        "already happened in 1993"
      ],
      "pause_after_seconds": 1,
      "pronunciation_notes": [],
      "inflection": "settled"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "P022",
      "anchor": "Then Investcorp began selling its own shares. In October 1995, it",
      "pace": "natural",
      "intent": "matter_of_fact",
      "emphasis": [
        "remaining fifty-two percent"
      ],
      "pause_after_seconds": 1,
      "pronunciation_notes": [],
      "inflection": "settled"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "P023",
      "anchor": "The share prices in those offerings were different: twenty-two do",
      "pace": "natural",
      "intent": "skeptical",
      "emphasis": [
        "not a clean calculation"
